vc-card\" href=\"/maklumat-pelayanan\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"/></svg></span><h3>Maklumat Pelayanan</h3><p>Pernyataan kesanggupan pengadilan untuk melayani sesuai standar yang telah ditetapkan.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/kompensasi-layanan\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"1 4 1 10 7 10\"/><path d=\"M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 2.13-9.36L1 10\"/></svg></span><h3>Kompensasi Layanan</h3><p>Bentuk tanggung jawab pengadilan apabila pelayanan tidak sesuai standar yang berlaku.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/layanan-disabilitas\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M13 7v5h5l2 5\"/><path d=\"M13 9h4\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4\"/></svg></span><h3>Layanan Disabilitas</h3><p>Fasilitas, aksesibilitas, dan pendampingan bagi penyandang disabilitas serta kelompok rentan.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/permohonan-informasi\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg></span><h3>Permohonan Informasi</h3><p>Prosedur memperoleh informasi publik melalui petugas informasi dan PPID pengadilan.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/regulasi-pengaduan\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5\"/><path d=\"M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07\"/><path d=\"M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14\"/></svg></span><h3>Pengaduan</h3><p>Dasar hukum dan kanal resmi penyampaian pengaduan, termasuk aplikasi SIWAS MA RI.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/tata-tertib-pengadilan\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/></svg></span><h3>Tata Tertib di Pengadilan</h3><p>Ketentuan yang wajib dipatuhi pengunjung selama berada di lingkungan pengadilan.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"/tata-tertib-ruang-sidang\"><span class=\"svc-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></span><h3>Tata Tertib Ruang Sidang</h3><p>Adab dan aturan yang berlaku selama persidangan berlangsung.</p><span class=\"svc-more\">Selengkapnya <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"svc-cta\"><div><h2>Butuh bantuan atau informasi cepat?</h2><p>Petugas PTSP kami siap membantu pada jam layanan. Anda juga dapat mengajukan perkara secara elektronik melalui e-Court Mahkamah Agung RI.</p></div><div class=\"svc-cta-buttons\"><a class=\"svc-btn svc-btn-gold\" href=\"https://wa.me/6281261256661\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg>Hubungi via WhatsApp</a><a class=\"svc-btn svc-btn-line\" href=\"https://ecourt.mahkamahagung.go.id/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"r